"Neither do I."
{n}She looks at you before offering her hand.{/n}

{n}Irabeth opens the door wearing the blue coat. The room behind her is warm, and the table has been cleared except for the two maps and a small bowl of walnuts.{/n}
"Anevia asked me to wear it again. I did not require much persuasion."
