"Unfinished. The moving figures were ready; the room's recorder never worked reliably. He brought the only finished miniature here. Vardess has his drawings, including a catalogue of the scenes he means to reproduce."
{n}She watches Serit while she speaks to you. Then she asks him something else. His hand stops halfway toward his cap.{/n}
