{n}Vesk laughs despite himself. He remains to hear the disputed ending.{/n}

{n}The sheet lies facedown while Runa sings. Gesmerha counts the verses on her fingers. Twice she takes a breath to correct a word and lets it go. Dera's version follows, shorter and less certain, with an ending that leaves the travelers on the far bank.{/n}
