{n}She makes room for you beside the case and shows you the ornament she has finally decided not to take. It is expensive, awkward to pack, and connected with a memory she no longer enjoys retelling. She has found a buyer for it. The transaction seems to please her more than keeping it ever did.{/n}

"Then say it before Minagho eats the last of those."
