{n}You wake with the memory of her laugh and no new obligation. The proposed undertaking can wait for another sleep.{/n}

"My agent can continue. There is one condition you should know before you begin choosing subjects for her kindness. Orren asked for protection. I offered it if he surrendered every profit from the voyages."
"Did he?"
