"Yes. I'm telling everyone I'm harmless. I've told everyone that my whole life." {n}She leans across the table.{/n} "Tell me what you see behind it."

{n}She tilts her head at the room: a dozen crusaders, a pair of merchants, a chaplain, two girls from the laundry, all drinking, all talking, all very much alive.{/n}
